<title>ISRAEL: Clal Electronics Q3 loss 50 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Clal Electronics Q3 loss 50 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Clal Electronic Industries Ltd, a subsidiary of Clal Israel, reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			(in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>	     Q3 96	 Q3 95	  9-MTH 96	 9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Income    31,749	37,527	 169,733	  222,523</p>
<p>Pre-tax   48,840-Loss  6,840-Profit 58,153-Profit 103,992-Profit</p>
<p>Net	 49,514-Loss  8,082-Profit 55,725-Profit  99,198-Profit</p>
<p>($1 = 3.23 shekels)</p>
</text>
